            <div xml:id="m-da1eb25b-1060-46fa-9a45-d585f207d0ce">
              <lg xml:id="m-a8d4996f-923d-4949-b3ae-8b55dd32157e">
                <l xml:id="m-e593afde-91d6-418a-82e2-a22bec81fee8" facs="#m-7ccee61c-9e36-44a8-ae5d-ff17026a7e89" label="ambiguous">Good Friday</l><l xml:id="m-1f0d27d3-cea3-4a60-9e70-7b7e3e2b2779" facs="#m-93506798-dca4-44ab-ab08-997b31bca538" label="ambiguous">704</l><l xml:id="m-f1cf6f50-cab1-4786-9036-f0e56e0722c4" facs="#m-763e13c1-4e40-43bf-87fa-a483b082fbfe" label="lyrics-like">Dé¬ us mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-d88d983d-ad2d-4c22-8c36-aad01fccc2e5" facs="#m-5aed229a-290a-45f2-9869-547b36a85acd" label="lyrics-like">ut quid me dere¬ liquí¬ sti?</l><l xml:id="m-636977fd-b139-4df1-800e-c2d762e8cc00" facs="#m-2ffee50f-8158-4834-ba0b-12ffbbd9af3b" label="ambiguous">us,</l><l xml:id="m-4d6f2fdd-2ead-481e-b8bf-01d798b9b6ee" facs="#m-5473ca6e-f1ac-4114-bd11-9a83a4341c01" label="lyrics-like">Et incliná-to cá¬ pi-te,</l><l xml:id="m-bf58287f-6946-44e7-9e1e-3f2ed4f51b8a" facs="#m-171f1511-f073-49d7-978b-cdd26388a83c" label="lyrics-like">emí-sit</l><l xml:id="m-43898779-f72d-4ae9-a286-03e69260f55b" facs="#m-6aea2f4b-8262-4fa8-8352-9d090635847a" label="lyrics-like">spí-ri- tum.</l><l xml:id="m-0cc4e136-86ce-45ce-a7b4-675625a953da" facs="#m-75e153dd-cde9-43d3-9aa8-ad0d7ee31f2f" label="lyrics-like">V. Exclá- mans Jésus vóce mágna, á¬ it: Pá¬ ter, in</l><l xml:id="m-01713c58-617b-4edb-ab95-a6dfffbe90a0" facs="#m-f7e2f3d9-85bd-43ba-966c-a177b4aea9d7" label="lyrics-like">mánus tú-as comméndo spí¬ ri-tum mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-d415a68c-ced5-4a3c-b7b6-94d1d6a70839" facs="#m-d7d9310a-5581-4266-a334-48569f90454c" label="ambiguous">um.</l><l xml:id="m-8af7d90b-d7cf-4abc-b391-a7996c66c50e" facs="#m-8bd8fc96-26a0-4afc-9ccf-bb101b31571a" label="lyrics-like">Et inclináto.</l><l xml:id="m-247b13a1-7628-497f-918a-0d1e6658c827" facs="#m-d70a817b-a6f3-4779-b7f8-38b670018529" label="ambiguous">LESSON VI</l><l xml:id="m-0da58f03-1603-4706-9321-b0dbe4e55510" facs="#m-aa6bd55e-9480-4e3a-b379-51249ec90cd3" label="lyrics-like">? Xacuérunt tamquam gládium num flagellávit, sed eórum furóri</l><l xml:id="m-bbffe97a-55bd-4ede-b719-be5ae9a118d4" facs="#m-a4d7f819-3f67-4584-8122-76177e90e135" label="ambiguous">U linguas suas. Non dicant Ju¬</l><l xml:id="m-e24b582d-7bd8-4fc0-a174-0f721aa9429b" facs="#m-89fd8ad3-364f-459c-bc84-92cee0f2f084" label="lyrics-like">satisfácere volens: ut vel sic</l><l xml:id="m-44788a1c-f97e-4e8b-8764-24ccec44d3db" facs="#m-dfb2198f-ca4b-4bd7-820b-22f8097eba41" label="lyrics-like">daéi: Non occidimus Christum.</l><l xml:id="m-50e3ea6a-2e7b-4363-8d53-96bd0e27e9c6" facs="#m-6616bbf2-d1c3-48f1-a510-602a6c501b27" label="lyrics-like">jam mitéscerent, et desinerent</l><l xml:id="m-7dab67d8-8613-405b-820b-d79eca635f8b" facs="#m-862048dd-6e34-401b-b21f-c2baa45b08a5" label="lyrics-like">Etenim proptérea eum dedérunt</l><l xml:id="m-4d066456-2997-4b3c-8ebf-eddf3ba4799d" facs="#m-1bc571c6-eac9-4310-9e21-7eca43ea53e1" label="lyrics-like">velle occidere, cum flagellátum</l><l xml:id="m-cb31a610-b8ff-4055-97de-78b921668c23" facs="#m-e31110e7-abb7-46a4-8b42-b476d95a56b3" label="lyrics-like">júdici Piláto, ut quasi ipsi a</l><l xml:id="m-f8371481-8fcc-41d6-8fc9-f33193c7a99a" facs="#m-3b18d90c-eb28-4773-8b4f-a577c519c45a" label="lyrics-like">vidérent. Fecit et hoc. At ubi</l><l xml:id="m-6a14a8aa-854d-47ca-aa47-2f6ecc016854" facs="#m-c8d3fe55-1363-488a-ac82-5fd5b9b922fb" label="lyrics-like">morte elus videréntur immúnes.</l><l xml:id="m-884e7775-07cb-426b-8cb6-c7d4c7133a3a" facs="#m-88ca265f-11d8-4464-ad3b-9375037e2821" label="lyrics-like">perseveravérunt, nostis illum</l><l xml:id="m-06b17f92-23a5-4563-afe1-aa7b5806ee54" facs="#m-86dc0faf-24f0-4d69-9b64-b605ed74d92f" label="lyrics-like">Nam cum dixisset eis Pilátus:</l><l xml:id="m-e9bc0115-c549-44e9-b898-a8048bd0d651" facs="#m-fee0cd7d-f02d-4dea-8eef-5b92aa63e915" label="ambiguous">lavisse manus, et dixisse, quod</l><l xml:id="m-b6b4ebd0-433c-4994-874a-1c7afdaa5ab1" facs="#m-26e57282-7bd0-4d39-9fae-3d96d65fdbed" label="lyrics-like">Vos eum occidite, respondérunt:</l><l xml:id="m-bcdc0970-3c1f-4706-a2a7-085f787b5eb1" facs="#m-74069d14-ce1f-49ba-a271-bf7c178ef65d" label="ambiguous">ipse non fecisset, mundum se</l><l xml:id="m-d8ad5dad-e1bc-49d2-868e-9cf6bb38a85b" facs="#m-3c08e44b-bc8a-4984-b457-27b4ab416770" label="ambiguous">Nobis non licet occidere quem¬</l><l xml:id="m-aaae48cc-94ea-4549-9643-f792972db4d9" facs="#m-4c3fcaa7-1176-4751-a49f-153b81117072" label="ambiguous">esse a morte illius. Fecit tamen.</l><l xml:id="m-3dfbe26d-8c28-497b-bcea-44444de17bd6" facs="#m-bd28bfc8-acad-4521-a6db-94bd7717838d" label="ambiguous">Sed si reus, quia fecit vel</l><l xml:id="m-9629332f-6817-40b2-a5e0-aa0d86b2843c" facs="#m-4581f728-e3a6-4175-8a67-53a853a03694" label="lyrics-like">quam. Iniquitátem facínoris sui</l><l xml:id="m-51039fcc-0b13-47b4-a5fc-ee454238f9cd" facs="#m-afce7aea-5899-4ec7-a8b9-e1a1c8efd709" label="lyrics-like">in júdicem hóminem refúndere</l><l xml:id="m-e020dc96-4b5d-4d6d-b464-3dfda69dcfdf" facs="#m-f6e094c3-c7cc-451f-af4b-0cd55a29f4d9" label="lyrics-like">invitus: illi innocéntes, qui</l><l xml:id="m-40340bbe-3600-421e-879f-8f244965afab" facs="#m-54bbabb9-4238-4af2-8c1d-e0a10a200048" label="lyrics-like">volébant: sed numquid Deum</l><l xml:id="m-faf58f74-4bb2-4767-8722-16dbf9cab6c8" facs="#m-04145838-0c3e-4a62-9771-12f60af4f9ba" label="lyrics-like">coëgérunt ut fáceret? Nullo mo¬</l><l xml:id="m-6f22b51d-9c6a-4987-a8f3-7a0ca859f8b5" facs="#m-510dfebf-a6ee-4bd6-8710-d490341d89a8" label="lyrics-like">judicem fallébant? Quod fecit</l><l xml:id="m-850e8f9f-4177-4e97-9737-13c8a447e866" facs="#m-8d38eaa3-a04f-43b4-8cfa-51797772377a" label="lyrics-like">do. Sed ille dixit in eum sentén¬</l><l xml:id="m-bc19505c-942a-476c-a006-26eafd11cfc4" facs="#m-35381dbc-26d3-4ce0-a997-0f61de07a601" label="lyrics-like">Pilátus, in eo ipso quod fecit,</l><l xml:id="m-8b17298e-e111-4d4b-9770-a4fde4054bd2" facs="#m-43b7f5ee-3f19-4bf8-9f53-36c813c18c32" label="ambiguous">tiam, et jussit eum crucifigi, et</l><l xml:id="m-ea91ebcc-ea5a-4eff-972a-4e340e3231e4" facs="#m-69331a99-a1ef-4fff-91ee-0885c416a09f" label="lyrics-like">aliquántum párticeps fuit: sed</l><l xml:id="m-5b11f762-8cd9-4982-9631-d50224f91ebf" facs="#m-ba8313e4-866d-4a1f-837a-79efcf750dd8" label="ambiguous">quasi ipse occidit: et vos, o</l><l xml:id="m-d58bff59-2211-461e-8e66-b10b68af7325" facs="#m-47b64c02-79d8-43e2-82f6-08c7b8adc10e" label="lyrics-like">in comparatióne illórum, multo</l><l xml:id="m-a25e5bdb-2823-4b5d-b927-81269987a0c7" facs="#m-267ac254-d93d-477a-a9d0-ec6018ecbece" label="lyrics-like">Judaéi, occidistis. Unde occidí¬</l><l xml:id="m-74f2c4af-70c0-4ea2-afb3-1e5464dd7e3d" facs="#m-5048c879-8eb2-4d8f-a6e0-6c69d7c5d4bc" label="lyrics-like">ipse innocéntior. Institit enim</l><l xml:id="m-bfe00da6-8f03-4fab-8410-272ebac6d60d" facs="#m-e65530b9-ea5b-4a16-a291-cb2b231a92ed" label="lyrics-like">stis? Gládio linguae: acuistis</l><l xml:id="m-2a2d06e7-d623-48b5-bccf-1b7f1a2b544f" facs="#m-bef4d403-06ff-4dd2-9e10-ef7bfda7cc1c" label="lyrics-like">quantum pótuit, ut illum ex</l><l xml:id="m-9e54b1bf-8820-463a-9103-ee53a30f25be" facs="#m-7a8155a5-caa3-4de2-a7c4-83f99fc78709" label="ambiguous">enim linguas vestras. Et quando</l><l xml:id="m-f269b7ac-2920-4c32-847c-7da4b2969a1c" facs="#m-8ecec8e5-99fe-4ed9-9306-ad5980c8e556" label="lyrics-like">eórum mánibus liberáret: nam</l><l xml:id="m-a30058dd-e5a6-4326-8e11-0ed35fab67c5" facs="#m-4fa87547-bd2d-4edf-a653-ba575d119231" label="lyrics-like">percussístis, nisi quando clamá¬</l><l xml:id="m-b7e04fe3-7047-46fb-a174-486e1b0faf86" facs="#m-62b15540-f208-4d17-8c11-e0ee23679931" label="lyrics-like">proptérea fagellátum produxit</l><l xml:id="m-2285f855-5420-496c-b978-4379b8626c80" facs="#m-4c47ad3f-b590-47cf-9964-1242c993f54c" label="ambiguous">stis: Crucifige, crucifige?</l><l xml:id="m-183c4a94-d466-406f-9734-cf452882d115" facs="#m-b37f9797-6743-46cf-a982-4d1ec9f9ecb0" label="lyrics-like">ad cos. Non persequéndo Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-80cf98c3-c535-4a80-a47e-a3d1fc227e99" facs="#m-8522aff5-3db9-46de-be5c-e4bcde8da0f4" label="ambiguous">Resp.6</l><l xml:id="m-89c410f1-dcf2-4eda-8010-a7fe6aaa6a22" facs="#m-46c2720a-fb03-45f7-9d50-05dec2dde67b" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-ac69847d-e3c5-456e-b9f0-3d17f16ae961" facs="#m-bf19c914-1896-4b60-8c50-f115fbc7b535" label="lyrics-like">-nimam mé-am</l><l xml:id="m-cedc879d-da2f-497a-9d4e-2740b3600328" facs="#m-6a4a34ea-9f80-471b-bb35-9148f74fa3ae" label="lyrics-like">di-lé-ctam trádi¬</l><l xml:id="m-f0385a26-e3ea-4d42-8026-d67709821f70" facs="#m-77c8cf04-62a8-463b-ba1a-e933b33f241f" label="ambiguous">di</l><l xml:id="m-f1bf48c5-daef-4405-8d10-852a795919e8" facs="#m-5becc33c-915b-46df-b7f1-ec0485f03de4" label="lyrics-like">in má¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>